From aa4507dc7317f0948bbda2657b7ac287afba9f7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: spartanz51 <a.m@tuta.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:09:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [sdk] Decrypt AEAD attribute values encrypted with a group
 key

Values encrypted with the AEAD v2 scheme (359/360 profile) are decrypted
with the owner group key of the version recorded in the ciphertext and
the instance's KDF nonce, as TS AeadWithGroupKeyDecryptor does. Instances
carrying a KDF nonce go through this path, including decrypt_parsed.
Writing such instances is refused until AEAD writes are supported.
